<p><m>\int_a^b h(x)\ dx</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
<p><alert> (d) </alert> Find and evaluate exactly an integral expression, <m>\int_a^b h(x)\ dx</m>, that represents the area between <m>y = g(x)</m> and the <m>x</m>-axis on the interval between the intersection points of <m>f</m> and <m>g</m>.</p>
<p><m>a</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0006"/></p>
<p><m>b</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0007"/></p>
<p><m>h(x)</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0008"/></p>
<p><m>\int_a^b h(x)\ dx</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0009"/></p>
<p><alert> (e) </alert> What is the exact area between <m>f</m> and <m>g</m> between their intersection points?</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0010"/></p>
